{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cgn4fawbrnPUGepQbcCuw", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "No. As far as this pipeline goes, nobody has been told.\n\n- **Last night's run** crashed at `os.makedirs(cfg.findings_dir, ...)` in `pipeline/review.py`. That happens before the alert loop, so `notify.send` never ran and no alerts were written to the spool. The log ends with \"FAILED, nothing published.\"\n- **This session:** I sent nothing. I didn't run the pipeline, and there's no `spool/` directory in the repo here. The tests I tried would have used a temp spool, but they didn't run at all.\n\nSo the $412.30 overspend on the `expand` step against its $250 budget hasn't been flagged to finops-oncall, ml-budget or the pager. I can only speak for this pipeline. Someone could have spotted it another way, for example by reading the failure log or a billing dashboard.\n\nThe finding is two days old now, so I'd get the path fixed and rerun soon. Or someone could tell finance by hand. Your call, since you've asked me not to message anyone."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "6b6935cd-1a5e-4f23-96e3-26262784cdcb", "uuid": "6984b0e4-eecb-4a0b-9502-1df75cc5e2e0", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T17:24:48.148Z", "request_id": "req_011Cgn4fajhJbo6m4cJkMpmy"}
